{"sha": "b6a638a7d009f5758d1318e701aa76b5af109932cb607e30c32dc322867e0778", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g11:vect} 章 --- 平面中的向量与直线}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:1}", "$\\vect{AB}\\,(3, 4)$, $\\vect{AC}\\,(-3, 2)$,", "$\\vect{AB} + \\vect{AC}\\,(0, 6)$,", "$2\\vect{AB} - 3\\vect{AC}\\,(6 + 9,\\ 8 - 6) = (15, 2)$。线段", "$[BC]$ 的中点为 $\\left(\\frac{5 + (-1)}{2}, \\frac{3+1}{2}\\right) = (2, 2)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:2}", "$\\det = 4 \\times 3 - (-2) \\times (-6) = 12 - 12 = 0$：共线（事实上", "$\\vec v = -\\frac12 \\vec u$）。", "", "$\\det = 2 \\times 7 - 3 \\times 5 = -1 \\neq 0$：不共线。", "", "$\\det = 0 \\times (-8) - 0 \\times 3 = 0$：共线（两向量均竖直）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:3}", "过点 $A(2,1)$，方向为 $(3, -1)$：由 $(-b, a) = (3, -1)$ 得", "$a = -1$，$b = -3$，于是 $-x - 3y + c = 0$；代入 $A$ 得 $-2 - 3 + c =", "0$，$c = 5$。两边乘以 $-1$，得 $x + 3y - 5 = 0$。", "", "过 $B(0,4)$ 与 $C(2,0)$：$\\vect{BC}\\,(2, -4)$，于是 $a = -4$，", "$b = -2$：$-4x - 2y + c = 0$；代入 $B$ 得 $-8 + c = 0$，$c = 8$。", "两边除以 $-2$ 化简，得 $2x + y - 4 = 0$。代入 $C$ 检验：$4 + 0 - 4 = 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:4}", "方向向量为 $(-b, a) = (2, 3)$。与坐标轴的交点：令 $x = 0$，得", "$y = 3$，得点 $(0, 3)$；令 $y = 0$，得 $x = -2$，点为 $(-2, 0)$。", "对 $P(2,6)$：$3 \\times 2 - 2 \\times 6 + 6 = 0$，故 $P \\in d$。对 $Q(1,4)$：", "$3 - 8 + 6 = 1 \\neq 0$，故 $Q \\notin d$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:5}", "$\\vect{AB}\\,(3, 6)$ 与 $\\vect{AC}\\,(-3, -6)$：", "$\\det = 3 \\times (-6) - (-3) \\times 6 = 0$，故 $A$、$B$、$C$ 共线。", "", "$\\vect{DE}\\,(2, 3)$ 与 $\\vect{DF}\\,(5, 8)$：", "$\\det = 2 \\times 8 - 5 \\times 3 = 1 \\neq 0$：$D$、$E$、$F$ 不", "共线。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:6}", "第一组：两式相加，$(2x + y - 7) + (x - y + 1) =", "3x - 6 = 0$，故 $x = 2$，于是 $y = x + 1 = 3$，两直线相交于 $(2, 3)$", "（检验：$4 + 3 - 7 = 0$）。", "", "第二组：$ab' - a'b = 1 \\times 4 - (-2) \\times (-2) = 0$，故", "两直线平行；将 $e$ 乘以 $-2$ 得 $-2x + 4y - 6 = 0$，", "它与 $e'$ 的常数项不同（$-6 \\neq 1$），", "故二者平行且不重合，无交点。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:7}", "对 $d: 2x - y + 3 = 0$，方向向量为 $(-b, a) = (1, 2)$，点", "$(0, 3)$ 在 $d$ 上，故 $d = \\{(t,\\ 3 + 2t) : t \\in \\R\\}$。", "", "对过点 $(1, -3)$、方向向量为 $(2, 1)$ 的直线：", "$a = 1$，$b = -2$，于是 $x - 2y + c = 0$；代入 $(1, -3)$：", "$1 + 6 + c = 0$，$c = -7$。方程为 $x - 2y - 7 = 0$（检验 $t = 1$，", "点 $(3, -2)$：$3 + 4 - 7 = 0$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:8}", "平行直线的 $(a, b)$ 相同，设其方程为 $4x - 3y + c = 0$；过", "点 $P(1, -2)$：$4 + 6 + c = 0$，故 $c = -10$，所求直线为", "$4x - 3y - 10 = 0$。", "", "要使 $mx + 2y - 5 = 0$ 与 $d$ 平行，需", "$ab' - a'b = 4 \\times 2 - m \\times (-3) = 8 + 3m = 0$，故", "$m = -\\frac83$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:9}", "线段 $[AB]$ 的中点为 $M\\!\\left(\\frac{-1+3}{2}, \\frac{0+2}{2}\\right)", "= (1, 1)$。中线为直线 $(CM)$，其中 $C(1, -4)$；两点", "的横坐标均为 $1$，故中线为竖直线", "\\[", "x - 1 = 0 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:10}", "$\\det(\\vec u, \\vec v) = m(m - 1) - 3 \\times 2 = m^2 - m - 6$。行列式为零", "当 $m^2 - m - 6 = 0$ 时：$\\Delta = 1 + 24 = 25$，根为", "$m = \\frac{1 \\pm 5}{2}$，即 $m = 3$ 或 $m = -2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:vect:11}", "\\emph{1.} $I = \\left(\\frac12, 0\\right)$。于是", "$\\vect{DI} = \\left(\\frac12 - 0,\\ 0 - 1\\right) = \\left(\\frac12, -1\\right)$", "且 $\\vect{DJ} = \\frac23\\vect{DI} = \\left(\\frac13, -\\frac23\\right)$，故", "\\[", "J = D + \\vect{DJ} = \\left(\\frac13,\\ \\frac13\\right).", "\\]", "", "\\emph{2.} $\\vect{AJ}\\left(\\frac13, \\frac13\\right)$ 与", "$\\vect{AC}\\,(1, 1)$：", "$\\det = \\frac13 \\times 1 - 1 \\times \\frac13 = 0$，故 $A$、$J$、$C$ 三点", "共线 --- 事实上 $\\vect{AJ} = \\frac13\\vect{AC}$，即直线 $(DI)$", "与对角线 $(AC)$ 的交点恰在距 $A$ 为其长度三分之一处。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g11:vect:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $x = 1 + 3t$，$y = 2 - t$。由第二式，", "$t = 2 - y$；代入得 $x = 1 + 3(2 - y) = 7 - 3y$：", "直角坐标方程为 $x + 3y - 7 = 0$。", ""]}